@kpo_result
title: The KPO ledger moves
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.kpo_funds_available =
    Number.isFinite(Number(Q.kpo_funds_available))
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.kpo_funds_available))
        : 0;
Q.kpo_funds_spent =
    Number.isFinite(Number(Q.kpo_funds_spent))
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.kpo_funds_spent))
        : 0;
Q.kpo_delivery =
    Number.isFinite(Number(Q.kpo_delivery))
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.kpo_delivery))
        : 0;
Q.kpo_milestones =
    Number.isFinite(Number(Q.kpo_milestones))
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.kpo_milestones))
        : 0;
Q.kpo_public_credit =
    Number.isFinite(Number(Q.kpo_public_credit))
        ? Number(Q.kpo_public_credit)
        : 0;
Q.kpo_deadline_pressure =
    Number.isFinite(Number(Q.kpo_deadline_pressure))
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.kpo_deadline_pressure))
        : 0;
Q.kpo_shortcut_debt =
    Number.isFinite(Number(Q.kpo_shortcut_debt))
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.kpo_shortcut_debt))
        : 0;
Q.kpo_funds_delayed =
    Number.isFinite(Number(Q.kpo_funds_delayed))
        ? Math.max(0, Number(Q.kpo_funds_delayed))
        : 0;
Q.kpo_uncommitted = Math.max(
    0,
    Q.kpo_funds_available - Q.kpo_funds_spent
);
Q.kpo_progress_band =
    Q.kpo_delivery >= 24
        ? "Delivery visible"
        : (Q.kpo_delivery >= 12
            ? "Delivery partial"
            : "Delivery fragile");
!}

= [+ kpo_progress_band +]

[+ kpo_last_summary +]

**Ledger:** [+ kpo_milestones +] milestone points · [+ kpo_delivery +]
delivery · [+ kpo_funds_spent +] of [+ kpo_funds_available +] funding blocks
committed · [+ kpo_deadline_pressure +] deadline pressure.

[? if kpo_last_credit_change >= 4: **Our imprint is unmistakable.** Voters can
name what Lewica forced, and our partners can no longer fold it into a generic
government success.?]
[? if kpo_last_credit_change >= 1 and kpo_last_credit_change < 4:
**We have a claim, not ownership.** Our work is visible, but coalition partners
remain in the photograph and will contest the authorship.?]
[? if kpo_last_credit_change = 0: **The ledger moves without us.** The result
is administrative or belongs to the institution that acted.?]
[? if kpo_last_credit_change < 0: **We lose the story.** Work may continue, but
another party owns it or our factions inherit the blame.?]

[? if kpo_last_delivery_change >= 4: People, contracts and projects now move;
the advance is large enough to survive the press conference.?]
[? if kpo_last_delivery_change >= 1 and kpo_last_delivery_change < 4:
Some implementation advances, but the next review can still expose what the
coalition left unfinished.?]
[? if kpo_last_delivery_change = 0: We changed scrutiny or ownership, not what
the state can deliver.?]
[? if kpo_last_delivery_change < 0: The paper file improved by displacing work
that people could have used.?]

[? if kpo_last_funds_change > 0: A new funding block has been unlocked, still
subject to completion and audit.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Continue
